<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/40 via-[#0d0d12]/90 to-purple-950/30 p-8 sm:p-12 mb-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -top-10 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -left-10 -bottom-10 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                ZenithPrime Pro Boosting Hub
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
                Jasa Joki Game <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-indigo-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Terpercaya & Bergaransi</span>
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
                Raih rank impianmu tanpa pusing dark system atau beban tim. Dikerjakan langsung oleh pro player verified tier <b>Radiant, Immortal, & Mythical Glory</b> dengan jaminan 100% keamanan akun, tanpa cheat, dan pengerjaan kilat.
            </p>

            <!-- Trust Highlights Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10">
                    <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-1">🛡️</div>
                    <div class="text-white text-xs font-bold">100% Akun Aman</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">Privasi & data terenkripsi</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10">
                    <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-1">⚡</div>
                    <div class="text-white text-xs font-bold">Pengerjaan Kilat</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">Estimasi 1-24 jam beres</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10">
                    <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-1">🎯</div>
                    <div class="text-white text-xs font-bold">0% Cheat / Murni</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">Pro player manual skill</div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/10">
                    <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-1">📱</div>
                    <div class="text-white text-xs font-bold">Live Progress</div>
                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-[10px]">Pantau status di web 24/7</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Title & Filter -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Pilih Game Favoritmu</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-0.5">Tersedia joki per bintang, paket hemat full tier, penempatan placement, dan quest explore.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Tersedia <b class="text-cyan-400"><%= games.length %></b> Game Populer</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Games Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <% games.forEach(game => { %>
            <div class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#121217] border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/50 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)] hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>

                <div>
                    <!-- Game Card Top -->
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shrink-0 bg-black/40 p-1 group-hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition">
                            <img src="/images/games/<%= game.thumbnail %>" alt="<%= game.name %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300" onerror="this.src='/images/ZenithPrimeLogoTransparant.png'">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-cyan-300 text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase mb-1">
                                <%= game.category %>
                            </span>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition leading-snug">
                                <%= game.name %>
                            </h3>
                            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                                <%= game.service_count %> Pilihan Paket Joki
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Features Checklist for this game -->
                    <div class="space-y-1.5 py-3 border-t border-b border-white/5 my-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                            <span>Req Hero / Role favorit bebas</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                            <span>Garansi win streak tinggi & anti-minus</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                            <span>Bukti screenshot rank selesai diupload</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                    <!-- Footer with Price & Action Button -->
                <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Estimasi Mulai</div>
                        <div class="text-white font-extrabold text-base">
                            Rp <%= Number(game.min_price || 0).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/joki/<%= game.slug %>" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-indigo-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20 hover:shadow-cyan-500/40 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span>Buat Request Joki</span>
                        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% }) %>

        <!-- Special Card: Custom Request Bebas (All Games) -->
        <div class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/40 via-[#121217] to-cyan-950/30 border border-cyan-500/30 hover:border-cyan-400 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(6,182,212,0.25)] hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 w-32 h-32 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-cyan-500/30 shrink-0 bg-cyan-500/10 p-2 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">
                        ✨
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold uppercase mb-1">
                            Bebas & Fleksibel
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition leading-snug">
                            Custom Request Joki
                        </h3>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                            Semua Game / Kebutuhan Khusus
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-1.5 py-3 border-t border-b border-white/5 my-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>Request turnamen, quest harian, spiral abyss</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>Bisa mode mabar party tanpa beri password</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span>
                        <span>Tentukan budget & target sendiri</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Tipe</div>
                    <div class="text-white font-extrabold text-sm">Per Request Bebas</div>
                </div>
                <a href="/joki/custom-request" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 hover:from-indigo-400 hover:to-purple-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <span>Ajukan Request</span>
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How It Works Flow -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#121217] border border-white/10 p-8 sm:p-10 mb-16">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold">Langkah Mudah</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white mt-1">Bagaimana Cara Order Joki di ZenithPrime?</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">Hanya butuh 4 langkah mudah untuk menaikkan rank akun kesayanganmu secara instan dan aman.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 relative">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
                    01
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-1">Pilih Paket & Jumlah</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Tentukan rank awal, rank target, atau jumlah bintang yang ingin dinaikkan dengan kalkulator otomatis.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 relative">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
                    02
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-1">Isi Data Akun & Catatan</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Masukkan ID login, password, nomor WA aktif untuk koordinasi kode login, serta hero/role yang diinginkan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 relative">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
                    03
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-1">Bayar Otomatis</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Bayar via Midtrans (QRIS, GoPay, VA BCA, Mandiri, BNI, dll). Verifikasi status instan tanpa perlu manual konfirmasi.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 relative">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-4">
                    04
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-1">Pantau & Selesai</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Pantau live tracking di halaman status. Setelah rank tercapai, penjoki akan upload bukti screenshot dan logout.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Security & Guarantee Policy FAQ -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold">FAQ & Jaminan</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mt-1">Keamanan Akun Anda Adalah Prioritas Utama Kami</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Kami menerapkan standar operasional ketat untuk setiap worker penjoki ZenithPrime agar akun pelanggan terlindungi 100%.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-xs text-indigo-200">
                💬 Butuh pertanyaan khusus atau request joki custom? Hubungi kami via <b>Live Chat CS</b> kapan saja.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#121217] border border-white/10">
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">Q:</span> Apakah akun saya aman dari banned pihak game?
                </h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                    <b>Sangat Aman.</b> Penjoki kami 100% menggunakan skill tangan murni tanpa cheat, script injector, mod map, ataupun aplikasi pihak ketiga terlarang.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#121217] border border-white/10">
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">Q:</span> Bagaimana jika akun saya memakai verifikasi 2 Langkah / OTP?
                </h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                    Saat worker kami hendak login, worker akan menghubungi nomor WhatsApp aktif yang Anda daftarkan di formulir untuk meminta kode OTP secara real-time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#121217] border border-white/10">
                <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">Q:</span> Apakah penjoki boleh menyentuh Diamond / Skin / Hadiah saya?
                </h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                    <b>Dilarang keras.</b> SOP ZenithPrime melarang keras penjoki membelanjakan diamond, mengubah nickname, atau menghapus pertemanan. Pelanggaran akan berakibat pemecatan worker dan pengembalian dana 100%.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
